# BEES TEMPUS: every atom the TEMPUS units use on the wire (D30: reached through bees_atoms@a_<name>()).
# development-plan/tempus-design.md section 5. The units also use src/trust/bees_trust.atoms (the map walk of the token, the
# language's rejection atoms, TRUST's call, cast and result frames).
# message kinds (the value of t)
advert
pop_challenge
pop_response
key_rotated
shuffle
shuffle_reply
sample
sample_reply
done
# peer types (the value of store, and of a token's typ)
tempus_edge
tempus_bridge
tempus_sentinel
# keys of the frames and of the token (t, ver and token are TRUST's too)
d
id
pub
addr
nonce
sig
kid
store
entries
age
n
sub
typ
nbf
exp
